{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13666","headline":"赠送崔子向 · 严维","name":"赠送崔子向","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅食来江上，求名赴洛阳。\n新诗踪谢守，内学似支郎。\n行怯秦爲客，心依越是乡。\n何人作知己，送尔泪浪浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}